--- !u!114 &8428702419793330046
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6676775831917027833}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5c1186c79b996fb44b88878111c8a913, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _rotationSpeed: 5
  _dialogue:
  - speakerName: Log
    sentences:
    - Hoy el campamento no estaba como siempre.
    - "Aunque lo reviso seguido, hab\xEDa dejado algunos centinelas para limpiar
      cualquier corrupci\xF3n."
    - "Cuando volv\xED, ellos tambi\xE9n se hab\xEDan corrompido."
    - "\xA1No pod\xEDa cruzar al otro lado, donde est\xE1 el \xE1rbol junto a la
      carpa!"
    - "Purificarlos fue un l\xEDo, pero logr\xE9 dejar un sistema para la pr\xF3xima
      vez."
    - "Solo ten\xEDa que reflejar sus ataques y se purificaban solos..."
    - "Lo hice a las apuradas, as\xED que capaz algunas de esas placas de presi\xF3n
      tambi\xE9n est\xE9n medio rotas..."
    - "Las dej\xE9 entre la carpa y el \xE1rbol."
    - Aunque espero que nadie lo necesite...
    sentencesEnglish:
    - Today, camp was not as usual.
    - Even though I check it regularly, I had left some sentinels to clean ant corruption.
    - When I came back, they had been corrupted too.
    - "I couldn\xB4t get to the other side with the tree next to the tent!"
    - Trying to purify those was a mess but I managed to leave a system for next
      occations.
    - All I needed to do was reflect their attacks and they would purify themselves...
    - I did it in a rush, so maybe some of those pressure plates are messed up too...
    - I left them between the tent ant the tree.
    - I hope no one needs it though...
    speakerNames: []
